          'tables', case n when 7 then '[[["תרופה","כבד","דם"],["Primaquine","כן","—"],["Chloroquine","—","כן"],["Atovaquone-proguanil","כן","כן"]]]'::jsonb
                           when 9 then '[[["רק","שורה"]], "not a table"]'::jsonb
                           else '[]'::jsonb end) order by n) from generate_series(1, 20) n),
  'ready', :'maya');
